# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Ausgab schreiwen: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), nei-zeil.
Ausgab schreiwen: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), nei-zeil.
Ausgab schreiwen: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), nei-zeil.
Ausgab schreiwen: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), nei-zeil.
Ausgab schreiwen: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), nei-zeil.
Ausgab schreiwen: ([''] tccompare: ['']), nei-zeil.
